{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "corridor",
  "conversations": {
    "corridor_speaker": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cs_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cs_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "防火门上方装着一个喇叭，以前上课铃就是从这里传出来的。现在喇叭还开着。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "cs_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "cs_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "墙那边有一整个班的人在说话。声音挤在一起，过了一会儿突然停了，像是有人进了教室。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "cs_q_q"
        },
        {
          "id": "cs_q_q",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "那是 C 他们班。他们一直这样。",
          "next": "cs_3",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": [
              "q_companion"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cs_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "喇叭咔嗒响了两下，安静了。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "corridor_trolley": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "ct_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ct_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一辆清洁车横停在柜子前，轮子是朝里的。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "ct_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ct_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一把拖把、半桶水，还有一瓶黄色的清洁剂。后面的柜子里放着练习本，能从书脊看出来。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "ct_q_q"
        },
        {
          "id": "ct_q_q",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "桶就别动了。从周一搁到现在了。",
          "next": "ct_3",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": [
              "q_companion"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ct_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你没去动那辆清洁车。它只是挡住了柜子，别的地方都能走。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "corridor_wait": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cw_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cw_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你在栏杆边停下来。楼下的操场看起来和刚才在教室里看到的不太一样，颜色也变了。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "cw_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "cw_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "两个篮架，一间工具棚，一大片水泥地。看了一会儿，也没什么动静。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "cw_3"
        },
        {
          "id": "cw_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "这节课还在继续，只是跟你没什么关系。你倒也不觉得难受。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "corridor_waited",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "corridor_waited",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "自由时间里，你站在走廊栏杆边，看了一会儿操场。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
